              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "spollee"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe is so popular! It is amazing that people who are hesitant about caviar taste it and are instantly fans!\n I would suggest putting the caviar into a paper towel so that any liquid will be absorbed. This way the appearance of the appetizer will be better when you add it. \n Good in cold as well as warm weather.\n This is a good one!"
          },
