              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SaucyPeas1719"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have been making this recipe for Christmas every year for over 35 years. I rinse the caviar and then let it dry for a short time on a paper towel before putting on top of the pie. I also make it the night before without the caviar and let it set in the fridge, then serve it the following night. It's wonderful! My best recipe!!!",
